1.  **Motor Control with VNH3SP30 Driver**: The VNH3SP30 is a full H-bridge motor driver that can handle currents up to 30A. You can use it to control the speed of your cart's motor. The VNH5019A-E is a newer version of the VNH3SP30, but they are almost identical, with the main difference being the logic voltage compatibility [[1](https://github.com/bmellink/VNH3SP30)].
